OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,FOwners of an iconic Mumbles cafe have
OL,7,Fbeen left "devastated" after being hit
OL,8,Fby a fire overnight.
OL,10,FMid and West Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService were called to Verdi's in the
OL,12,Fearly hours of Thursday morning (30
OL,13,FJuly) following reports of an incident
OL,14,Fat Mumbles Road in Swansea.
OL,16,FThe blaze has forced the cafe to close
OL,17,Funtil further notice, in the peak
OL,18,Fsummer holiday months.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
