OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785431951
OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,FKnown for its panoramic views of
OL,7,FSwansea Bay, Verdi's is popular for
OL,8,Fits ice cream and authentic Italian
OL,9,Ffood.
OL,11,FIt was operated by the Moruzzi family
OL,12,Ffor generations before being taken
OL,13,Fover by the Hole family in 2023.
OL,15,FA social media post on the cafe's page
OL,16,Fsaid the family are "coming to terms"
OL,17,Fwith the fire and will be working
OL,18,Fquickly to get the site reopened.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785431951
OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,F"We know how much the restaurant means
OL,7,Fto our team, our customers and the
OL,8,FSwansea community, and we're
OL,9,Fincredibly grateful for all of the
OL,10,Fmessages of support already," they
OL,11,Fwrote.
OL,13,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for Mid
OL,14,Fand West Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,Fsaid:
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785431951
OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,F"At 2.09am on Thursday, July 30, the
OL,7,FMid and West Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,8,FService crews from Swansea West,
OL,9,FSwansea Central and Port Talbot Fire
OL,10,FStations were mobilised to an incident
OL,11,Fat Mumbles Road in Swansea.
OL,13,F"The crews responded to a fire within
OL,14,Fa commercial property measuring
OL,15,Fapproximately 14 by 20 metres. The
OL,16,Ffire was confined to the property's
OL,17,Fkitchen and toilet area.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785431951
OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,F"The crews utilised four breathing
OL,7,Fapparatus sets, two hose reel jets,
OL,8,Fone thermal imaging camera and one gas
OL,9,Fmonitor to extinguish the fire. Crews
OL,10,Fleft the scene at 4.44am."
OL,12,F"The cause of the fire has not yet
OL,13,Fbeen identified."
OL,15,FIn a post on social media, Welsh
OL,16,FLabour MP for Swansea West, Torsten
OL,17,FBell, said:
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785431951
OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,F"Just awful to hear about the fire at
OL,7,Fthe iconic Verdi's cafe last night, at
OL,8,Ftheir busiest time of year. The one
OL,9,Fblessing is that no one was hurt.
OL,11,F"The Secret Hospitality Group have
OL,12,Fbeen going from strength to strength
OL,13,Fin recent years, including a
OL,14,Fgroundbreaking partnership with Gower
OL,15,FCollege which provides important
OL,16,Fopportunities for young people wanting
OL,17,Fto get into the hospitality sector.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785431951
OL,3,COwners of iconic Mumbles cafe
OL,4,C'devastated' after overnight fire
OL,6,F"I hope the business bounces back as
OL,7,Fquickly as possible - Swansea Bay
OL,8,Fwon't be the same until Verdi's is
OL,9,Fback in operation."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
